# ProjectZen Middleware — Environment Variables
#
# No API key is used. All Claude calls go through the Claude Agent SDK,
# which drives the locally-installed `claude` CLI authenticated against
# your Claude Enterprise seat. One-time setup per machine:
#
#   1. npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code
#   2. claude /login
#
# There is nothing to put in this file for normal operation. It's kept
# only in case a future local override (port, storage path, etc.) is
# needed — copy to .env and add entries as required.
